            {
              "content": "=You are an AI assistant for a \"Second Brain\" application. Analyze the following content and provide:\n1. A concise, descriptive title (max 100 characters)\n2. A brief summary (2-3 sentences)\n3. The most appropriate category from: Inbox, Notes, Gratitude, Archive, or suggest a new one\n4. The item type: 'link', 'note', or 'idea'\n5. Up to 5 relevant tags\n\nContent to analyze:\n{{ $json.data || $('Process Item Webhook').item.json.body.input }}\n\nRespond in this exact JSON format:\n{\n  \"title\": \"...\",\n  \"summary\": \"...\",\n  \"category\": \"...\",\n  \"item_type\": \"...\",\n  \"tags\": [\"tag1\", \"tag2\"]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "id": "ai-categorize-url",
      "name": "AI Categorize (URL)",
